## What belongs here

Something you would do differently with more time, that is not currently broken. A `TODO:` in the code marks the spot; this file explains why it is there and what paying it off involves.

One line for the shortcut, one for the cost of keeping it, one for the way out. Link a ticket if one exists — and when the ticket lands, delete the entry rather than marking it done.

If an item has been here long enough that nobody remembers the tradeoff, that is a signal: either it stopped mattering (delete it) or it needs a ticket.

